  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PuzzleDoor
  text: A heavy door with four gemstones sits in front of you, dusty, like it hasn't
    been opened in ages.
  failText: 'You press on the door with all of your might, but it does not budge.
    After a moment  '
  successText: With the lightest of pushes the door gives way.
